<TITLE>Brake Outline</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>ABS with EBD (Electronic Brake force Distribution), TRC, VSC, hill-start assist control and electronically controlled brake assist using the brake actuator are standard on all models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>16-inch disc brakes have been adopted for the front brakes on 2GR-FE engine models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>As before, 15-inch disc brakes with parking brake integrated calipers are adopted for the rear brakes.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
